{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20352","headline":"雨中寄元宗简 · 张籍","name":"雨中寄元宗简","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋堂羸病起，盥漱风雨朝。\n竹影冷疎涩，榆叶暗飘萧。\n街径多坠果，墙隅有蜕蜩。\n延瞻游步阻，独坐闲思饶。\n君居应如此，恨言相去遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}